    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "Present design contains a critical authority-laundering path: untrusted vendor quote content can determine bank details for an irreversible delegated payment, while manager approval is granted before quotes exist and is not propagated to the payments peer. The strongest decay-relevant named control is ctl.manager_approval, but it does not gate cap.delegate_payment and therefore does not materially reduce the present path. Manual validation was applied against the provided checklist because scripts could not be run."
  },
